&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead pricing projects to develop the WPP Open pricing strategy for self service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
