&lt;li&gt;Support client assurance activities and security commitments for some of the world&#39;s leading brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders to maintain trust and confidence in WPP Open&#39;s security posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity, Resilience &amp;amp; Risk:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
