&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security challenges associated with cloud-native platforms, SaaS products and modern software delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of areas such as AI security, identity and access management, API security, client data protection and platform resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
