&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hiring Manager - Alex Carr&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recruiter - Gaby Hershkorn&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Job level - 5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is looking for a Senior Marketing Manager, Search and App to own two of our most important growth channels: paid search and app marketing across France, Italy and Belgium. You will set the strategy, own the budget, and lead the team responsible for turning media spend into profitable, sustainable growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a leadership role for someone who wants to build and run a high-performing performance marketing function inside a business that moves fast. Deliveroo operates in a dynamic, competitive market, and priorities shift quickly in response to what we learn. You will need to redirect budget, team focus, and strategy at short notice, sometimes across several markets or initiatives at once.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI is central to how this role will be delivered. You will be expected to actively use and champion AI tools — from automated bidding and creative generation to forecasting and anomaly detection — to make the channel more efficient and to free up the team to focus on higher-value strategic work. Experience of applying AI in a marketing or growth context, or a genuine appetite to build that experience quickly, is essential.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will operate within a matrix organisation, working alongside Brand, Growth, Product, Data Science, Finance, and regional General Managers. Success in this role depends on your ability to build trust and alignment across a wide group of stakeholders who do not report to you, and to keep them aligned even as plans change. This role will report into the Performance Marketing Director and work under our hybrid model - 3 days a week from our London HQ. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own the strategy, execution, and performance of paid search (Google, Bing, and other search platforms) and app marketing across France, Italy and Belgium.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliver growth in New Customers, Resurrections, New Vertical purchases and subscriptions to our loyalty programme efficiently for the channel. Manage the team to deliver against them alongside reporting performance to senior marketing and business leadership.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead, coach, and grow a team of paid search and app marketing specialists, building the capability the team needs as the business and the channels evolve.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Identify, adopt, and scale AI-driven tools and automation across bidding, creative production, measurement, and anomaly detection to improve performance and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own budget allocation across paid search and app, and reallocate spend quickly in response to performance, competitor activity, or changes in the market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Data Science, Engineering, and Analytics to build and refine attribution, measurement, and bidding models the team relies on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work as part of a matrix organisation, collaborating with Brand, Growth, Product, Finance, and regional General Managers to align a broad set of stakeholders around shared goals and trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Track platform and policy changes across Google, Apple, and Android, and adapt Deliveroo&#39;s approach ahead of competitors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Significant experience leading paid search and/or app marketing at scale, ideally in a high-growth consumer, marketplace, or on-demand business.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A track record of owning large budgets and delivering measurable efficiency and growth results against clear targets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;People leadership experience, having built, managed, and developed high-performing performance marketing teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with, or a strong appetite to quickly adopt, AI tools and automation as a core part of how you drive channel performance — this is a genuine expectation of the role, not a nice-to-have.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A demonstrated ability to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment. Comfortable changing direction, reprioritising, and moving between competing demands without losing momentum.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills and prior experience operating within a matrix organisation, able to influence and align stakeholders across functions without direct authority over them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and commercial rigour, comfortable with data, experimentation, and measurement, and able to turn numbers into a clear story and a clear recommendation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Manager, Global HR Compliance &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our People team are the architects of a great workplace where brilliant minds come together to do their best work. From discovering diverse talent and nurturing future leaders, to creating spaces that spark collaboration and crafting rewards that celebrate success - we&#39;re passionate about building a culture where everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Manager, People Operations &amp;amp; HR Compliance to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us define and lead our global HR compliance strategy across 30,000+ employees and 40+ countries—building a proactive, AI-enabled compliance function that is a trusted partner to the business and a clear enabler of how we grow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-people-team/&quot;&gt;People team&lt;/a&gt; — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Global People Operations team. The Global HR Compliance team is a critical capability within Global People Operations, owning the strategy, governance, and execution of employment compliance across the DoorDash brand ecosystem. This is a high-impact team operating at the intersection of legal obligation and people strategy, partnering closely with Legal, People Business Partners, Compensation, People Services, and People Technology to ensure that how we operate as an employer reflects both our values and our obligations. You’ll lead and grow an existing team of experienced compliance professionals and report directly to the Sr. Director, Head of Global People Operations, serving also as a strategic partner and right hand on the highest-priority cross-functional people operations initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and own the global HR compliance strategy&lt;/strong&gt; establishing a clear vision, operating model, and multi-year roadmap that is well understood across the People team and actively aligned to business priorities across the brand ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, develop, and grow the global HR Compliance team&lt;/strong&gt;, setting clear goals, creating mechanisms to communicate progress, and building a high-trust function that is known for proactive partnership rather than reactive oversight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive the execution of a robust compliance program&lt;/strong&gt; across core domains including SOX hire-to-retire controls, legislation management, mandated compliance reporting, employment handbook and policy governance, background checks, work authorisation, wage and hour, leave of absence, and employee data privacy ensuring consistent coverage across all geographies and brands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed AI and automation into the core workflows&lt;/strong&gt; of the compliance function using technology to enhance monitoring, streamline documentation, surface risk earlier, and scale the team’s capacity to operate proactively across a complex, global landscape.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and maintain strong cross-functional partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; with Employment Legal, People Business Partners, Compensation, and People Technology creating clear engagement models so that the right stakeholders know when and how to activate the Global HR Compliance team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop governance mechanisms and compliance reporting&lt;/strong&gt; that provide transparency into program health, surface emerging risks, and demonstrate measurable impact across the compliance roadmap—creating clear visibility for People leadership and key cross-functional partners.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a strategic partner and right hand&lt;/strong&gt; to the Sr. Director, Head of Global People Operations—driving operating rhythm, cross-functional prioritisation, and alignment across the Global People Operations leadership team on the highest-priority initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience leading HR compliance or employment law programs&lt;/strong&gt; in a high-growth, global technology company or similar fast-paced environment—with a strong track record of building and leading compliance functions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise across core HR compliance domains&lt;/strong&gt; including employment legislation management, SOX hire-to-retire controls, mandated reporting, policy governance, work authorisation, data privacy, and wage and hour—with the ability to navigate both UK/EMEA specifics and broader global complexity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability as a strategic operator&lt;/strong&gt; who can define a multi-year compliance vision and gain stakeholder buy-in, while also rolling up their sleeves to build process infrastructure, drive execution, and deliver against a roadmap with urgency and rigour.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated experience embedding AI and automation&lt;/strong&gt; into compliance or people operations workflows—with a clear point of view on how technology can be used to scale a proactive, intelligence-driven approach to employment compliance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong leadership and cross-functional influence skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with a history of building trusted partnerships with Legal, HR, Finance, and Technology teams—and a proven ability to create clarity and alignment in complex, matrixed, multinational organisations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Manager, Corporate Services Sourcing&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Finance team shapes the company&#39;s future by directing capital to high-impact investments, developing robust financial strategies, and ensuring we deliver long-term value while pursuing our ambitious mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Manager, Corporate Services Sourcing to join our team. This is a remote role based in Europe (preferred hubs: London, Berlin, Copenhagen, or Helsinki). In this role, you’ll help us lead the Corporate Services Sourcing team for the Deliveroo and Wolt brands, driving strategic category management and delivering commercial value across a multi-million-pound indirect spend portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-finance-team/&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Global Sourcing team within our Global Procurement organization, reporting into the Director, Head of Global Strategic Sourcing. You will lead a team of five (5) managing a broad portfolio across EMEA (including Professional Services, Global Security, Facilities/Real Estate, BPO, HR/Benefits, and Contingent Workforce), while partnering with the DoorDash Corporate Services team to capture global enterprise synergies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Category Strategy &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing sourcing team&lt;/strong&gt; of five, setting clear goals, driving accountability, and building capability across the Corporate Services portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and execute multi-year category strategies&lt;/strong&gt; that increase category maturity, optimise total cost of ownership (TCO), and unlock value beyond traditional cost savings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with DoorDash sourcing leads&lt;/strong&gt; to align global category strategies, leverage enterprise scale across brands, and capture cross-regional synergies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Supplier Management&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the end-to-end sourcing lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt; for high-stakes corporate procurement, including data analysis, RFx creation, proposal evaluation, and complex contract negotiations (MSAs/SOWs).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a trusted advisor and escalation point&lt;/strong&gt; for executive stakeholders across G&amp;amp;A functions (Finance, Legal, HR, Security) and core business lines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish best-in-class supplier ecosystems&lt;/strong&gt;, tracking performance, SLAs, and supplier risk while embedding ethical and sustainable sourcing (ESG) practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to procurement transformation initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, championing new tooling, AI-driven sourcing workflows, and continuous process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Essential&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience in Corporate Services Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;, with a proven track record of developing and executing strategic category plans across indirect spend categories.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated people management capability&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience leading, mentoring, and developing high-performing sourcing professionals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong commercial and negotiation acumen&lt;/strong&gt;, with proven ability to structure and negotiate complex commercial agreements (MSAs, SOWs) and utilise TCO modelling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional stakeholder engagement and communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, capable of influencing senior leaders, managing matrixed business partners, and driving cross-brand collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep risk management expertise&lt;/strong&gt;, including third-party risk assessments, contract governance, and mitigation strategies within multi-jurisdictional environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience working within the technology sector or high-growth, fast-paced marketplace environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with modern procurement and CLM platforms (e.g., Coupa, NetSuite, Pivot) and enthusiasm for applying AI tools in day-to-day sourcing workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience operating across European markets and diverse regulatory/legal structures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
