&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Agile Robots SE is a high-tech startup based in Munich. Our mission is to bridge the gap between AI and robotics by developing robotic systems that offer state-of-the-art full-body force sensitivity and world-leading vision intelligence. This unique combination of technologies enables us to provide intelligent, easy-to-use, and affordable robotic solutions with safe human-robot interaction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are a dynamic and innovative software development company dedicated to pushing the boundaries of technology. We specialize in creating cutting-edge solutions that transform industries and redefine user experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and implement a robust REST API and WebRTC-based communication server running on embedded Linux robot hardware&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Expose and maintain a well-defined API layer consumed by browser-based clients, either desktop or mobile (layouting)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Integrate the backend server with communication middleware (e.g. ROS2) to bridge robot internals and external consumers&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the server architecture end-to-end — including design, deployment, debugging, documentation, and release&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure API reliability, performance, and security within embedded Linux constraints&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with frontend and robotics software teams on interface contracts and integration&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop both rapid proof-of-concept implementations and production-grade server components&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or related field • 5+ years of professional backend development experience&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficient in Python; working knowledge of C++ in a systems or robotics context&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience designing and implementing REST APIs and real-time communication protocols (WebRTC)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with communication middleware (e.g. ROS2) and its underlying concepts (pub/sub, services, actions)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience deploying and operating backend services on embedded Linux systems as well as designing the frontend counterpart&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong understanding of API design principles, versioning, and documentation&lt;/div&gt;
