&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;Agile Robots is seeking a highly motivated Manager, Strategic Operations &amp;amp; Supply Chain Integration (m/f/d)to support the optimization, integration, and scaling of operational and supply chain activities across the Agile Group and its subsidiaries.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role will focus on driving operational excellence, enhancing supply chain performance, and supporting the integration of processes, systems, and best practices across a growing international organization. Working closely with operations, procurement, manufacturing, logistics, engineering, and subsidiary leadership teams, the successful candidate will identify improvement opportunities, lead strategic initiatives, and contribute to the development of a resilient and scalable operational footprint.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This position combines strategic thinking with hands-on execution and offers broad exposure across multiple business units, technologies, and international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Operations Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and execution of strategic operational initiatives across Agile Robots and its subsidiaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve operational efficiency, scalability, cost performance, and organizational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct operational assessments and develop recommendations to support business growth and operational maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives across manufacturing, engineering operations, and business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain Strategy &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
